    {
      "id": 108058,
      "message": "In January 2026, Iran’s internet was shut down. With no foreign journalists on the ground and no independent reporting, much of what happened was recorded by the people who were there.\u003cbr/\u003eAcross the country, people filmed protests, shootings, arrests, the wounded, the dead and the aftermath. Their footage reached the outside world in fragments, often without clear dates, locations or context.\u003cbr/\u003eThis Is Our Story brings these images together with first-hand accounts from eyewitnesses, survivors and bereaved families, revealing how events unfolded and what people experienced.\u003cbr/\u003eThe documentary restores context to isolated clips, preserves testimony and creates a fuller record of what happened. English subtitles make that record accessible beyond Iran.\u003cbr/\u003eAll four episodes are available on Manoto’s YouTube channel.\u003cbr/\u003eYouTube links in bio.",
